"          + ttnr ------------------------------------------------------------------------+          "
"          | 2.11 BSD UNIX (ttnr) (console)                                               |          "
"          |                                                                              |          "
"          | BBC Radio 6 Music + keys --------------------------------+                   |          "
"          | Lauren Laverne    |spc  play / pause                     |                   |          "
"          |                   |+ =  volume up                        |                   |          "
"          | The Strokes - Some|-    volume down                      |                   |          "
"          | Is This It (20th A|m    mute                             |                   |          "
"          |                   |n    next station                     |                   |          "
"          | HE-AAC  48 kHz  st|p    previous station                 |                   |          "
"          | > playing         |s    station list                     |                   |          "
"          | vol 80%  MAJOR IV |o    open URL                         |                   |          "
"          |                   |d    output device                    |                   |          "
"          | recent            |t    next theme                       |                   |          "
"          |   Wet Leg - Chaise|?    help                             |                   |          "
"          |   Khruangbin - Tim|q    quit                             |                   |          "
"          |   Fontaines D.C. -|]    track info later (+1 s)          |                   |          "
"          |                   |[    track info earlier (-1 s)        |                   |          "
"          |                   |b    line speed (terminal themes)     |                   |          "
"          |                   +--------------------------------------+                   |          "
"          |                                                                              |          "
"          |                                                                              |          "
"          | spc play  +/- vol  m mute  n/p station  s list  o url  ? help  q quit        |          "
"          +------------------------------------------------------------------------------+          "
